  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening IRCSL Capacity for Advocacy in Governance &amp; Rights in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-Religious Council of Sierra Leone (IRCSL) is increasingly involved in governance and rights, climate adaptation and resilience, and gender justice in Sierra Leone and recognizes the need to use evidence and engage with policy processes more effectively. The proposed project is designed to help achieve this by developing a partnership with Christian Aid Sierra Leone, which shares a commitment to peace building, national cohesion, governance &amp; rights, climate adaptation and resilience, and gender justice; the importance of evidence-based policy-making; and the value of Faith Leaders&#x2019; participation in the policy process.</narrative>
  </description>
